sequenceDiagram
    actor Seller
    participant P as Property
    participant L as My Listings
    actor Buyer
    participant N as Notification
    participant R as Region / Township
    participant V as PropertyView
    participant SP as SavedProperty
    participant A as Agent (Profile)
    participant C as Conversation
    participant M as Message

    Seller->>P: post listing (property / hostel, media)
    P-->>Seller: id + ad_number (PROP-xxxxx)
    P->>N: notify-new-property (fan-out)
    N-->>Buyer: new_property notification + push

    Buyer->>P: browse / search (deal, region, type, price, rooms)
    P->>R: filter by state_region_id / township_id
    R-->>P: matching rows
    P-->>Buyer: public listings (is_flagged = false)
    Buyer->>P: open property detail
    P->>V: increment_property_views(user_id)
    V-->>P: view counted
    P-->>Buyer: property + related
    Buyer->>SP: save (user_id, property_id)
    SP-->>Buyer: saved
    Buyer->>P: compare (add / remove / clear)
    P-->>Buyer: compare items
    Buyer->>A: view agent profile / call
    A-->>Buyer: listings + stats

    Buyer->>C: contact agent (property, buyer, seller)
    C-->>Both: conversation + unread counts
    Buyer->>M: send message (offer / question)
    M->>C: realtime INSERT
    M->>N: notify-new-message
    N-->>Seller: new_message notification + push
    Seller->>M: reply (text / attachment)
    M->>C: realtime INSERT
    M->>N: notify-new-message
    N-->>Buyer: new_message notification + push
    Both->>M: mark read (read_at)
    C-->>Both: unread cleared

    Buyer->>P: close the deal (negotiate & pay off-platform)
    P-->>Buyer: seller marks property sold / unavailable
    Seller->>L: manage listing (filter For Sale / For Rent / Sold)
    L-->>Seller: filtered listings
    Seller->>P: update is_sold = true, sold_at
    P-->>Seller: marked sold
    Seller->>P: delete listing
    P-->>Seller: removed